AI-Powered ARV Safety Checker

Project Description

This project aims to identify potential drug-drug interactions involving antiretroviral (ARV) medicines.

Technologies

- Python
- Artificial Intelligence
- Natural Language Processing (NLP)
- Graph Neural Networks (GNNs) - proposed enhancement

Main Features

- Medicine information input
- Potential interaction checking
- Safety alerts and explanations

Disclaimer

This is an educational prototype. It is not intended for clinical use. Medicine interaction results must be verified by qualified healthcare professionals using trusted medical references.

Setup

Python 3 is required. Setup instructions and dependencies will be added with the prototype code.